# =============================================================================
# Obsidian vault — track CONFIG, never STATE or SECRETS
#
# Tracked so a fresh clone (desktop OR mobile) opens ready-to-use:
#   .obsidian/*.json                  app/appearance/plugins/hotkeys/graph/types
#   .obsidian/snippets/*.css          CSS snippets
#   .obsidian/themes/Minimal/         the theme (vendored — mobile can't run a script)
#   .obsidian/plugins/*/main.js|manifest.json|styles.css
#                                     plugin binaries (vendored for the same reason;
#                                     obsidian-git especially — without it in git there
#                                     is no way to bootstrap sync on a phone)
#
# Ignored:
#   workspace*.json                   per-machine pane layout, churns every session
#   plugins/*/data.json               plugin settings — MAY HOLD API KEYS (Copilot does)
#                                     obsidian-git's is un-ignored below: no credential
#                                     fields, and its sync cadence must be versioned.
#   Verified by scripts/vault-check.sh in CI.
# =============================================================================
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.obsidian/plugins/*/data.json
!.obsidian/plugins/obsidian-git/data.json
.obsidian/plugins/*/*.js.map

# Obsidian local trash (trashOption: "local")
.trash/

# Ephemeral agent/working scratch — canonical knowledge lives in the visible vault
.workspace/

# IDE
.idea/
*.iml

# Claude Code machine-local settings
.claude/settings.local.json
# Regenerated by the session-start hook every session. Must stay ignored: the
# obsidian-git plugin auto-commits untracked files, so this would churn a commit
# on every session start.
.claude/workspace-context.md

# OS cruft
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
